    <MultiLanguageText Lang="en-GB" />
    <MultiLanguageText Lang="en-US">
Modulo calcuation according to IEC 61131-3:
* positive input value =&gt; positive return value
* negative input value =&gt; negative return value
  
If the input parameters are incorrect (moduloValue = 0.0) the return value of the function is zero.  
The following table describes the functionality of the function:

---

| Value          | moduloValue    | Return value   |
|:--------------:|:--------------:|:--------------:|
| 180            | 360            | 180            |
| 362            | 360            | 2              |
| -180           | 360            | -180           |
| -362           | 360            | -2             |
| 180            | 0              | 0              |

</MultiLanguageText>
